  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "🪄 dsh-photo-skins",
      "text": "[中文](README.zh.md) | English\n\nImport once. Auto-accent once. Turn any photo into a skin for the DSH Web GUI."
    },
    {
      "section": "🪄 dsh-photo-skins",
      "text": "Photo skins for the DSH Web GUI: import your own photos and turn them into\nthe interface skin. The photo paints the backdrop behind the GUI, and the\naccent colors are extracted from the photo automatically (dominant color as\nthe accent, photo-tinted light/dark readability veils). Rendering controls:\nfit (cover/contain), blur (0-100px, global or split empty/content), dim\n(0-100%) and the auto-accent toggle.\n\n0831Updates - A cordis plugin: enhance Web-Reach, page, reading and RSS."
    },
    {
      "section": "📥 Import photos three ways",
